@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 游客查询已发布的救助工单，不需要 Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rescue-orders/public?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 页码不合法，应返回业务错误 40005
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rescue-orders/public?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 每页数量不合法，应返回业务错误 40006
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rescue-orders/public?page=1&size=101
Accept: application/json
